{
  "info": {
    "name": "CampHubAPI",
    "description": "Berisi 28 request untuk menguji semua endpoint CampHubAPI. Panduan lengkap ada di `postman/README.md` pada repository.\n\nSebelum menjalankan:\n1. Jalankan backend (lihat README).\n2. Jika backend tidak berjalan di `http://127.0.0.1:8080`, ubah variabel `baseUrl` di tab Variables.\n\nFolder Autentikasi harus dijalankan lebih dulu, karena request di folder ini mengambil token login. Token dan ID data yang dibuat disimpan otomatis ke variabel collection, lalu dipakai oleh request berikutnya.\n\nAkun yang dipakai: USER rina@example.com, PROVIDER kodenusantara@example.com, ADMIN admin@example.com, serta satu akun baru dari request Register. Request memakai token USER, kecuali yang diatur lain di tab Authorization request tersebut.\n\nBootcamp, program, ulasan, pertanyaan, dan komentar yang dibuat selama pengujian dihapus kembali di akhir folder masing-masing. Akun dari request Register tidak dihapus.\n\nSetiap request dicek kode statusnya. Hak akses setiap endpoint ada di README bagian Endpoint.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{tokenUser}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autentikasi",
      "description": "Register dan login. Token disimpan ke variabel collection untuk dipakai folder lain.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) { pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenNewUser', pm.response.json().token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Tanpa token. Membuat akun USER baru dengan email unik. Token akun ini disimpan ke `tokenNewUser`.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pengguna Baru\",\n  \"email\": \"user{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login USER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenUser', pm.response.json().token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Tanpa token. Login dengan rina@example.com (USER). Token disimpan ke `tokenUser`.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"rina@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
